Description:You control Winding Constrictor, Elite Vanguard, two Swamps and a Forest, and have Cannibalize and Battlegrowth in hand. End the turn with exactly four +1/+1 counters on Elite Vanguard.
Rule:rulesguru-42d471503ae16113 | A spell's instructions are followed in the order written (CR 608.2c): Cannibalize exiles Winding Constrictor before it puts the counters, so they get no extra counter; Battlegrowth must go first, while the Constrictor is still there (2 + 2 = 4)
